<title>FINLAND: VAAHTO 12-MTH PROFIT RISES TO FIM 32.9 MLN.</title>
<headline>VAAHTO 12-MTH PROFIT RISES TO FIM 32.9 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to Feb 28,</p>
<p>					  (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items, tax    32.9 vs 14.7</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   8.15 vs 3.62</p>
<p> Net sales					  264.9 vs 162.5</p>
<p> Operating profit				  34.6 vs 13.0</p>
<p> Operating profit before depreciation	41.5 vs 16.8</p>
<p> Depreciation					 6.9 vs 3.8</p>
<p> Net financial items		     charge 1.7 vs 1.6 gain</p>
<p> Extraordinary gains				 56 vs 17</p>
<p> Extraordinary expenses			   2.0 vs nil</p>
<p> Profit before appropriations, taxes	   31 vs 14.7</p>
<p> Taxes						  9.4 vs 4.4</p>
<p> Net profit					  22.9 vs 10.7</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)	    47.9 vs 48.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish process industry equipment maker</p>
<p>group is Vaahto Group Ltd Oy.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
